#
# Build with newer clang releases than AOSP clang r416183b.
# Merged by: kernel/build-kernel.sh -W
#
# GKI enables CONFIG_WERROR, so new compiler warnings in MediaTek drivers
# (e.g. -Wbitwise-instead-of-logical with clang 14+) stop the build.
# build-kernel.sh -W also passes -Wno-error=<warning> for the warnings that
# MediaTek driver Makefiles promote with their own -Werror.
# This only changes compiler flags; the kernel ABI (KMI) is unchanged.
#
# CONFIG_WERROR is not set
